{"no":20,"title":"One Man in a Boat","titleZh":"独坐孤舟","audio":"L20.mp3","duration":91.12,"question":{"en":"Why is fishing the writer's favourite sport?","zh":"为什么钓鱼是作者最喜爱的一项运动？"},"sentences":[{"i":0,"t":15.15,"t2":22.27,"en":"Why is fishing the writer's favourite sport?","zh":"为什么钓鱼是作者最喜爱的一项运动？","meta":true},{"i":1,"t":22.27,"t2":26.2,"en":"Fishing is my favourite sport.","zh":"钓鱼是我特别喜爱的一项运动。","chunks":[{"c":"VP","x":"is sport","g":"动词短语"},{"c":"NP","x":"my favourite sport","g":"形容词修饰名词"}],"pat":"主系表","gp":["一般现在时","主系表句型"]},{"i":2,"t":26.2,"t2":31.64,"en":"I often fish for hours without catching anything.","zh":"我经常一钓数小时却一无所获。","chunks":[{"c":"VP","x":"often fish","g":"动词短语"},{"c":"PP","x":"without catching anything","g":"介词短语作定语/表语"},{"c":"PP","x":"for hours","g":"介词短语作定语/表语"}],"pat":"主谓+状语","gp":["一般现在时","主谓+状语句型"]},{"i":3,"t":31.64,"t2":35.02,"en":"But this does not worry me.","zh":"但我从不为此烦恼。","chunks":[{"c":"VP","x":"does not worry me","g":"动词短语"}],"pat":"主谓宾","gp":["否定的 not","主谓宾句型","并列结构"]},{"i":4,"t":35.02,"t2":38.16,"en":"Some fishermen are unlucky.","zh":"有些垂钓者就是不走运。","chunks":[{"c":"VP","x":"are unlucky","g":"动词短语"},{"c":"NP","x":"Some fishermen","g":"冠词+名"}],"pat":"主系表","gp":["一般现在时","主系表句型"]},{"i":5,"t":38.16,"t2":40.55,"en":"Instead of catching fish,","zh":"他们往往鱼钓不到，","chunks":[{"c":"PP","x":"Instead of catching fish","g":"介词短语作定语/表语"}],"pat":"主谓+状语","gp":["主谓+状语句型"]},{"i":6,"t":40.55,"t2":44.35,"en":"they catch old boots and rubbish.","zh":"却钓上来些旧靴子和垃圾。","chunks":[{"c":"VP","x":"catch boots","g":"动词短语"},{"c":"NP","x":"old boots","g":"形容词修饰名词"}],"pat":"主谓宾","gp":["一般现在时","主谓宾句型","并列结构"]},{"i":7,"t":44.35,"t2":47.04,"en":"I am even less lucky.","zh":"我的运气甚至还不及他们。","chunks":[{"c":"VP","x":"am lucky","g":"动词短语"},{"c":"ADJP","x":"even less lucky","g":"形容词短语"}],"pat":"主系表","gp":["一般现在时","比较级","主系表句型"]},{"i":8,"t":47.04,"t2":52.39,"en":"I never catch anything --not even old boots.","zh":"我什么东西也未钓到过——就连旧靴子也没有。","chunks":[{"c":"VP","x":"never catch anything","